WEBVTT

00:05:59.595 --> 00:06:03.584
is two elephants who are released together
arrive at the apparatus.

00:06:03.608 --> 00:06:06.408
The apparatus is on the left,
with food on it.

00:06:06.836 --> 00:06:09.858
And so they come together,
they arrive together,

00:06:09.882 --> 00:06:12.175
they pick it up together,
and they pull together.

00:06:12.199 --> 00:06:14.515
So it's actually fairly simple for them.

00:06:16.285 --> 00:06:17.435
There they are.

00:06:25.206 --> 00:06:26.764
So that's how they bring it in.

00:06:26.788 --> 00:06:28.945
But now we're going to make it
more difficult.

00:06:28.969 --> 00:06:30.789
Because the purpose of this experiment